  "interpretation": "39 new exact audited statements for the unchanged equation eq:p0-apollonius-pencil and its immediately surrounding zero-pole classification prose. Actual complex norms, Euclidean metric spheres and the vertical equidistance line are identified; positive parameters give proper circles or a line. The original 36-statement ripple module is rebuilt and audited as an import, not counted as new. No new theorem-like manuscript environment is invented.",
